Changelog CI (Jivy Group fork)
==============================

This repository is a fork of the "Changelog CI" GitHub Action:

    Upstream project: https://github.com/saadmk11/changelog-ci
    Upstream author:  Maksudul Haque (saadmk11)
    Upstream license: MIT (see LICENSE)

Fork point
----------

Forked from upstream commit 235aaf1f27be30946e4463fcb3d4f2864e807445
("Merge pull request #110 from saadmk11/release-1.2.0", 2025-07-15),
which corresponds to upstream release 1.2.0.

Fork location: https://github.com/jivygroup/changelog-ci

Modifications
-------------

This fork has been modified from the upstream original. Changes made by
Jivy Group are recorded in this repository's git history. Notable changes:

  * Dockerfile: Debian base updated from bullseye to bookworm, keeping
    upstream's Python 3.12 (python:3.12-slim-bookworm).
  * Dockerfile: OCI/Action metadata labels repointed from the upstream
    repository to this fork.

